BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winter school break (Vinterferie) (varies locally)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260216
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260228
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-vinterferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nWinter school break
  (Vinterferie)\n\nOne school week in ISO week 8 OR 9\, set locally (by the
  municipality\, kommune\, for primary and lower-secondary school\; by the 
 county\, fylkeskommune\, for upper-secondary school) under the Education A
 ct (opplæringslova) § 14-1. The national entry spans both weeks — chec
 k the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dok
 ument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Easter school break (Påskeferie) (varies locally)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260328
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260408
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-paskeferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nEaster school break
  (Påskeferie)\n\nSchools close from the Monday before Maundy Thursday thr
 ough Easter Monday\; some municipalities (kommuner) add the Tuesday. Range
  shown: Saturday before Palm Sunday to Easter Tuesday. Peak cabin and moun
 tain season.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
