 ic holiday (Act on 1 and 17 May as public holidays\, lov om 1. og 17. mai 
 som høgtidsdager). Norway's biggest food\, ice-cream\, sausage\, bunad (n
 ational costume) and party-wear moment\; also the end of the russ season (
 russetid).\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1947-04-26-1
