BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holiday pay lands (Feriepenger utbetales)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260601
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-feriepenger-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Holiday pay lands (Feriepenger utbetales)\n\nThe Holidays Act 
 (ferieloven) § 11: holiday pay is paid on the last regular payday before 
 the holiday — for most employees the June salary\, when the ordinary tax
  deduction is also skipped. Payday varies by employer\, hence the month ra
 nge.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-21
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-21
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Last day of school (Skoleslutt) (varies locally)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260617
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260625
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-skoleslutt-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nLast day of school 
 (Skoleslutt)\n\nSet in each municipality's school calendar (skolerute\; op
 plæringslova § 14-1)\; usually a weekday between ~17 and 24 June. Oslo's
  last day was Fri 18 June 2027 and is Thu 22 June 2028 — no stable weekd
 ay rule\, so a range.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-0
 6-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
