DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-sankthansaften-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Midsummer Eve (Sankthansaften)\n\nBonfires and grilling on 23 
 June\; not a public holiday (SNL).\n\nSource: https://snl.no/sankthans
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://snl.no/sankthans
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Collective summer holiday (Fellesferie)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260725
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-fellesferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Collective summer holiday (Fellesferie)\n\nTraditionally ISO w
 eeks 28–30 in July\, recommended by NHO (the Confederation of Norwegian 
 Enterprise) and Fellesforbundet (the United Federation of Trade Unions) fo
 r industry (6–24 July in 2026). The Holidays Act (ferieloven) § 5 lets 
 employees claim 3 weeks' main holiday between 1 June and 30 September (htt
 ps://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-21). B2B goes quiet\; travel\, 
 grilling and cabin peak.\n\nSource: https://www.thelocal.no/20210702/felle
 sferie-everything-you-need-to-know-about-norways-collective-holiday-period
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.thelocal.no/20210702/fellesferie-everything-you-need-to-kn
 ow-about-norways-collective-holiday-period
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Back to school (Skolestart) (varies locally)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260822
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-skolestart-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nBack to school (Sko
 lestart)\n\nFirst school day is set locally\, usually mid-August (ISO week
  33 or 34) — Bergen even varies the weekday (Fri 14 Aug 2026\, Mon 16 Au
 g 2027)\, so it keeps the national range. Back-to-school is also the autum
 n restart ("høstoppstart") for B2B: offices fill up again after the colle
 ctive summer holiday (fellesferie).\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument
 /NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Autumn school break (Høstferie) (varies locally)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260928
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-hostferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by municipality (kommune) — this is the national 
 range. Check the local school calendar (skolerute).\n\nAutumn school break
  (Høstferie)\n\nOne school week in ISO week 40 or 41\, set locally (e.g. 
 Oslo and Bærum week 40\; Trondheim\, Haugesund and Nord-Aurdal week 41 in
  2026). The national entry spans both weeks.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no
 /dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
