UID:moment-julebord-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Christmas-party season (Julebordsesongen)\n\nWorkplace Christm
 as parties cluster on Friday/Saturday evenings from mid-November to mid-De
 cember. No official dates\; the range is a planning convention. Venues boo
 k up by early autumn.\n\nSource: https://snl.no/julebord
