DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-black-week-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Black Week\n\nNorwegian retailers stretch Black Friday into a 
 week — commonly Monday of Black Friday week through Cyber Monday. Many s
 tart earlier ("Black November")\; treat the start as the latest safe go-li
 ve.\n\nSource: https://www.bi.no/forskning/business-review/articles/2021/1
 1/gi-norske-forbrukere-en-gronnere-black-friday/
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
