DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261225
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-julehandel-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Christmas shopping season (Julehandelen)\n\nRetail's peak seas
 on. Now effectively starts with Black Week and runs to Christmas Eve (jula
 ften)\; Virke (the Federation of Norwegian Enterprise) reports November + 
 December as the Christmas shopping (julehandel) period.\n\nSource: https:/
 /www.virke.no/analyse/julehandel/
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.virke.no/analyse/julehandel/
