SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Black Friday\n\nThe day after US Thanksgiving (4th Thursday of
  November + 1). Imported convention\; Norway's single biggest online-retai
 l day.\n\nSource: https://snl.no/Black_Friday
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://snl.no/Black_Friday
END:VEVENT
