DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-forste-advent-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:First Sunday of Advent (1. søndag i advent)\n\nFour Sundays b
 efore Christmas Day\; always 27 Nov – 3 Dec. Advent calendars must be in
  store before.\n\nSource: https://snl.no/advent
